--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description:
This directory holds the legacy implementation of the nvstreammux (N-to-1 stream
multiplexing) and nvstreamdemux (1-to-N stream demultiplexing) elements. It is
built as the static library libnvdsgst_multistream_legacy.a and is linked into
the nvmultistream plugin built from gst-nvmultistream2, which selects between
the legacy and the new streammux implementation at runtime.
Refer to the DeepStream SDK documentation for a description of the plugin.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pre-requisites:
- GStreamer-1.0 Development package
- GStreamer-1.0 Base Plugins Development package

Install using:
   sudo apt-get install libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-dev libgstreamer1.0-dev

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing the library:

  $ Set CUDA_VER in the MakeFile as per platform.
  $ sudo make (sudo not required in case of docker containers)
  $ sudo make install (sudo not required in case of docker containers)

The library libnvdsgst_multistream_legacy.a is installed at
/opt/nvidia/deepstream/deepstream/lib/gst-plugins/

Build this library before building gst-nvmultistream2, which links against it.
